n":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"not_legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{3}{W}{B}","name":"Rampage of the Valkyries","oracle_id":"49039519-62db-4605-b600-cef6f34c893f","oracle_text":"When this enchantment enters, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying and vigilance.\nWhenever an Angel you control dies, each other player sacrifices a creature of their choice.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2021-02-05","toughness":null,"type_line":"Enchantment"},{"cmc":5.0,"color_identity":["W"],"colors":["W"],"defense":null,"keywords":["Flying","Vigilance"],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"legal","standardbrawl":"legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{3}{W}{W}","name":"Serra Angel","oracle_id":"4b7ac066-e5c7-43e6-9e7e-2739b24a905d","oracle_text":"Flying\nVigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)","power":"4","produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2026-04-24","toughness":"4","type_line":"Creature — Angel"},{"cmc":4.0,"color_identity":["B","G","R"],"colors":["B","G","R"],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"not_legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"not_legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{1}{B}{R}{G}","name":"Shattergang Brothers","oracle_id":"7fb63d9a-8d90-4b43-8390-924de2d7e32c","oracle_text":"{2}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Each other player sacrifices a creature.\n{2}{R}, Sacrifice an artifact: Each other player sacrifices an artifact.\n{2}{G}, Sacrifice an enchantment: Each other player sacrifices an enchantment.","power":"3","produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2022-07-08","toughness":"3","type_line":"Legendary Creature — Goblin Artificer"},{"cmc":0.0,"color_identity":["B"],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"legal","standardbrawl":"legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"","name":"Swamp","oracle_id":"56719f6a-1a6c-4c0a-8d21-18f7d7350b68","oracle_text":"({T}: Add {B}.)","power":null,"produced_mana":["B"],"released_at":"2026-06-26","toughness":null,"type_line":"Basic Land — Swamp"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"As the last ability resolves, if it’s not your turn, the first player to choose a creature they control is the player whose turn it is. If it is your turn, the next player in turn order chooses first. In either case, each other player in turn order then chooses a creature they control, knowing the choices made before their choice. Then all chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.","oracle_id":"49039519-62db-4605-b600-cef6f34c893f","published_at":"2021-02-05","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The last ability of Rampage of the Valkyries will trigger whenever any Angel you control dies, not just the one created by the first ability.","oracle_id":"49039519-62db-4605-b600-cef6f34c893f","published_at":"2021-02-05","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If multiple creatures you control die at the same time, Grave Pact's ability will trigger that many times.","oracle_id":"6f4ac4a4-53ec-4bc9-8f5c-d4b801d867b2","published_at":"2023-09-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If two players each control a Grave Pact and a creature controlled by one of those players dies, a chain reaction happens. First the ability of that player's Grave Pact will trigger, causing each other player to sacrifice a creature. That sacrifice causes the ability of the other player's Grave Pact to trigger, and so on.","oracle_id":"6f4ac4a4-53ec-4bc9-8f5c-d4b801d867b2","published_at":"2023-09-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you control more than one Grave Pact and a creature you control dies, each of the triggered abilities will trigger. Each other player will sacrifice a creature each time one of those abilities resolves.","oracle_id":"6f4ac4a4-53ec-4bc9-8f5c-d4b801d867b2","published_at":"2023-09-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"In a Two-Headed Giant game, when a creature you control dies, Grave Pact's triggered ability will cause each other player, including your teammate, to sacrifice a creature. Grave Pact's ability won't trigger when a creature your teammate controls dies.","oracle_id":"6f4ac4a4-53ec-4bc9-8f5c-d4b801d867b2","published_at":"2023-09-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"None of the players are targeted. A player with hexproof would still sacrifice a creature.","oracle_id":"6f4ac4a4-53ec-4bc9-8f5c-d4b801d867b2","published_at":"2023-09-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"When the triggered ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is (if it isn't your turn) chooses which creature they will sacrifice, then each other player in turn order does the same, then all chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.","oracle_id":"6f4ac4a4-53ec-4bc9-8f5c-d4b801d867b2","published_at":"2023-09-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If multiple creatures you control die at the same time, Dictate of Erebos's triggered ability will trigger that many times.","oracle_id":"7c777a41-e40a-4b40-96bf-8ddd5c12924c","published_at":"2014-04-26","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you and an opponent each control a Dictate of Erebos and a creature dies, a chain reaction happens. First the ability of one player's Dictate of Erebos will trigger, causing each opponent to sacrifice a creature. That sacrifice causes the ability of the other player's Dictate of Erebos to trigger, and so on.","oracle_id":"7c777a41-e40a-4b40-96bf-8ddd5c12924c","published_at":"2014-04-26","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you control more than one Dictate of Erebos and a creature you control dies, each of the triggered abilities will trigger. Each opponent will sacrifice a creature each time one of those abilities resolves.","oracle_id":"7c777a41-e40a-4b40-96bf-8ddd5c12924c","published_at":"2014-04-26","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"None of the opponents are targeted. An opponent with hexproof would still sacrifice a creature.","oracle_id":"7c777a41-e40a-4b40-96bf-8ddd5c12924c","published_at":"2014-04-26","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"When the triggered ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is (if that player is an opponent) chooses which creature they will sacrifice, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, then all chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.","oracle_id":"7c777a41-e40a-4b40-96bf-8ddd5c12924c","published_at":"2014-04-26","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
